## Environment Files

### `dev.tfvars`

```hcl
environment = "dev"
aws_region  = "us-east-1"
vpc_id      = "vpc-xxxxxxxx"

private_subnet_ids     = ["subnet-xxxxxxxx", "subnet-yyyyyyyy"]
